Predefined Functions
Predefined Functions
Plant Simulation provides the predefined functions listed in the table of contents to the left, which you can
use in your controls.
Functions are not object-specific, they apply in general.
Operating System Functions
_Operating System Functions
SimTalk provides the functions listed in the table of contents to the left for accessing functions of the
operating system.
Predefined Functions
