SHGetKnownFolderPath [SimTalk]
Returns the path of a standard folder in the file system of your computer.
Type
Function
Syntax
SHGetKnownFolderPath(CLSID:string) -> string
Parameter
The parameter CLSID of data type string designates a standard folder in the file system of your computer.
For more information, consult KNOWNFOLDERID.
Return Value
The return value has the data type string.
Example
print SHGetKnownFolderPath("{B4BFCC3A-DB2C-424C-B029-7FE99A87C641}")
 // returns the path to the Desktop, for example 
C:\Users\MyLoginName\Desktop
See also
https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/shell/knownfolderid
SHGetKnownFolderPath [SimTalk]
